 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-13500 (20 threads) - 31.78 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe children relationship line is only drawn as such if the cell selected on the parent is the first, when it should be drawn if any cell is selected on the parent. Below, the normal relationship lines are drawn in red, the parent relationship lines are drawn in green, and the children relationship lines are drawn in blue.\n\n| First Cell Selected | Second Cell Selected |\n|--------|--------|\n| <img width=\"1156\" height=\"361\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/42ba3441-1779-4d56-8f72-93af1d9b5215\" /> |<img width=\"1160\" height=\"355\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d78fce6d-f9b0-48c5-8c69-984c356fb6bd\" />|\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a `Tree` with more than 1 column\n2. Set `draw_relationship_lines` to >0\n3. Set `relationship_line_color` and `children_hl_line_color` to different values\n4. Select any cell except for the first in an item with children\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[tree-rl.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22008205/tree-rl.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github